			(property "Description" "16 MHz Crystal\n\nhttps://www.digikey.com/product-detail/en/epson/FA-20H-16.0000MF10Z-AJ5/SER4201TR-ND/7430936 Digikey Link\n\nCrystal Attributes:\n\n• Frequency: 16 MHz\n• Frequency Stability: +/- 10ppm\n• Frequency Tolerance: +/- 10ppm\n• Load Capacitance: 8pF\n• ESR: 80 Ohms\n• Operating Mode: Fundamental\n• PAD 2 and PAD 4 are GROUNDED"
